# Build products of installation/build.sh.
#
# The two indexes are ~29,000 small files and ~400 MB, so they are built rather
# than committed, and they are written outside the project by default: this
# tree is often kept in iCloud Drive, which responds to that many small files
# by making a conflict copy of every one of them. serve.py serves whichever
# location it finds. See installation/README.md.
installation/data/index/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
